.claude/

# Older hand-written QA logs (kept locally, not part of the repo history)
QA_LOG.md
QA_REPORT.md

# Tauri build artifacts (deps + linker output, large + machine-specific)
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/

# Source PNG used to generate the Tauri icon set is checked in as
# `src-tauri/icons/app-icon.png` so the icon set can be regenerated;
# the generated icons themselves stay tracked so a fresh clone can
# build the desktop app without running `tauri icon` first.
